OL,3,GNEWSASecurity guard acquitted over
OL,4,Aman's death outside shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA security guard jailed for the
OL,7,Fmanslaughter of an alleged shoplifter
OL,8,Fhas been acquitted after a retrial.
OL,10,FSabeur Trabelsi, 48, was sentenced to
OL,11,Fsix years after a trial in 2023 heard
OL,12,F51-year-old Jason Page hit his head on
OL,13,Fthe ground after being chased from a
OL,14,FMarks & Spencer in Lower Earley,
OL,15,FBerkshire, in 2021.
OL,17,FPage died in hospital the following day
OL,18,Fand Trabelsi was convicted at Reading
OL,19,FCrown Court of manslaughter and
OL,20,Fperverting the course of justice.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
